---
import '@fontsource/yuji-syuku';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Yoruyaki - November 2026';

---

<BaseLayout title={title} />
<main>
  <span class='date'>2026.11.28</span>
  <section class="top-notes">
    <h2>焼きターキー</h2>
    <p>
      This event is going to be a little different, instead of the jungle fowl native to Asia, we'll be using our own North American native bird, the turkey. The skewers should be roughly the same and we plan to supplement with some chicken hearts and gizzards as they are a crowd favorite. There are also going to be some tweaks to the usual vegetable skewers we offer. We'll still have the same great sake & salt or tare coating though. Let's see how turkey compares to chicken at this special edition Yaki Turkey event!
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>コース</h2>
    <div class='items'>
      <p>A set course to open the meal with edamame, pickles, potato salad, soup, six skewers and rice. After being served feel free to order any other skewers you see below or on the hanging board.</p>
      <div class='item'>
        <h3>枝豆</h3>
        <p>boiled young soybeans, salt</p>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <h3>ぬか漬け</h3>
        <p>assorted rice bran pickles</p>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <h3>ポテトサラダ</h3>
        <p>potato, carrot, onion, cucumber, corn, mayo</p>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <h3>スープ</h3>
        <p>chicken broth, dashi, daikon</p>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/sasami'>
          <h3>ささみ</h3>
          <p>tender, sake, salt, wasabi</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <h3>芽キャベツ</h3>
        <p>brussel sprouts, sake, salt, pepper</p>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/mune'>
          <h3>胸</h3>
          <p>breast, yuzu kosho</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <h3>ズッキーニ</h3>
        <p>zucchini, tare</p>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/negima'>
          <h3>ねぎま</h3>
          <p>thigh, scallion, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/tsukune'>
          <h3>つくね</h3>
          <p>meatball, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <h3>炊き込みご飯</h3>
        <p>rice, mushrooms</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>串焼き</h2>
    <div class='items'>
      <p>
        Various types of skewers with limited amounts, click on the name to go to a page with more detail. When ordering check the board to see if they are still available. Shichimi, yuzu kosho, and lemon are available as toppings.
      </p>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/shishitou'>
          <h3>しし唐</h3>
          <p>shishitou pepper, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/eringi'>
          <h3>エリンギ</h3>
          <p>king oyster mushroom, miso dengaku</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/nasu'>
          <h3>なす</h3>
          <p>eggplant, tare, ginger</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/sasami'>
          <h3>ささみ</h3>
          <p>tender, sake, salt, wasabi</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/tebamotoreggu'>
          <h3>手羽元レッグ</h3>
          <p>drumette, leg, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/tebanaka'>
          <h3>手羽中</h3>
          <p>wing, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/obisori'>
          <h3>おびそり</h3>
          <p>inner thigh, oyster, sake, salt</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/furisode'>
          <h3>ふりそで</h3>
          <p>shoulder, sake, salt</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/harami'>
          <h3>ハラミ</h3>
          <p>belly, sake, salt</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/kawa'>
          <h3>皮</h3>
          <p>skin, sake, salt</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/bonjiri'>
          <h3>ぼんじり</h3>
          <p>tail, sake, salt</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/seseri'>
          <h3>せせり</h3>
          <p>neck, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/hizanankotsu'>
          <h3>膝軟骨</h3>
          <p>knee cartilage, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/yagennankotsu'>
          <h3>ヤゲン軟骨</h3>
          <p>keel cartilage, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/sunagimo'>
          <h3>砂肝</h3>
          <p>gizzard, sake, salt</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/hatsu'>
          <h3>ハツ</h3>
          <p>heart, sake, salt</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class='item'>
        <a href='/skewers/reba'>
          <h3>レバー</h3>
          <p>liver, tare</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<style>
  main {
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 75ch;
  }
  .date {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: right;
  }
  section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 8fr;
  }
  .items {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    column-gap: 1rem;
    border-left: 1px solid rgb(173, 165, 159);
    padding-left: 2.2rem;
  }
  section h2 {
    font-family: 'Yuji Syuku', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    writing-mode: vertical-lr;
  }
  section h3 {
    font-family: 'Yuji Syuku', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  section a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .items > p {
    font-style: italic;
    grid-column-start: span 2;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .images {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-items: center;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .images img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 600px;
    height: auto;
  }

  .images iframe {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 600px;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    border: none;
  }

  .notes, .top-notes {
    display: block;
  }

  .notes h2 {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans Variable', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 2rem;
    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
  }

  .notes a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .notes p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .top-notes h2 {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 2rem;
    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .items {
      padding-left: 1rem;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>

